nebflow.agent.FreezeSilenceSpec:
  + provider failure freeze: ZERO upward notification (parent mailbox + parent ref), panel says needs-you-but-auto-recoverable, wake entry stays 0.979s
  + one wave of 6 provider-failure freezes: notification count = 0 and the quiet digest reads 6 1.839s
  + deterministic-defect freezes produce exactly ONE aggregated alert for the whole wave (and no repeat on the next tick) 0.93s
  + auto-resume: waits while no provider serves, then resumes the SAME session via UserInput (never RestartAgent) with zero notification 0.484s
  + auto-resume budget: capped attempts with growing gaps, and only an exhausted budget escalates to ONE alert 0.46s
  + flow-notify: an infrastructure-fault node failure is never reported upward, a deterministic one still is 0.009s
nebflow.actor.FreezeDisplaySpec:
