nebflow.agent.DelegateFrozenWakeSpec:
  + MailIdleGate: a Frozen session is deliverable (a frozen delegate has zero in-flight work — the Mail IS the wake carrier) 0.006s
  + TurnBoundaryDrains: a frozen receipt is NOT a sub-agent result (the parent's barrier slot must not be returned early) 0.002s
  + visibleExternalEventSource: a frozen receipt renders on its own `delegate-frozen` source (not as a completion report) 0.023s
  + wakeFrozen refuses records that are not in the delegate-error frozen state (never starts a fresh session silently) 0.103s
  + wakeFrozen resumes the SAME session id from the persisted transcript: history in place, wake banner injected (finished work is not redone), frozen slot cleared, task row back to running 0.838s
